                                "sense_id": "bd30025b-cb53-3e8e-81b2-23930e60dec9",
                                "text": "Even without theatrical shoes on, Erlys was taller than Luca Zombini, and kept her fair hair in a Psyche knot, out of which the less governable tresses continued, with the day, to escape."
